E. the claim separates what must be separated, and nothing more
  ok    two stores ringing up an IDENTICAL basket are separate claims
  ok    two cashiers at the same store ringing up an identical basket are separate claims
  ok    a different quantity is a different claim
  ok    a different discount is a different claim
  ok    a different variant of the same product is a different claim
  ok    the same basket assembled in a different order is the SAME claim
